{"w":["2026-11-09","2026-11-15"],"built":"2026-11-09T21:04Z","pending":43,"N":["","Nature's Way NZ describes its Pea Protein powder as a \"low-allergen, vegan protein\".","Nature's Way NZ Acai Powder: \"Gluten free, dairy free, vegan, Non GMO, soy free.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan\" for these turmeric tablets.","L'OR FAQ: \"The coffee in our L'Or Espresso capsules is suitable for both vegetarian and vegan diet.\"","Nature's Way NZ Kale Powder: \"Vegan, gluten-free, dairy free and non GMO.\"","Kellogg's product page states \"Suitable for vegans\"; the NZ page lists the same ingredients.","Jed's FAQ: \"Yes, Jed's coffee is by nature suitable for vegetarians and vegans.\" No dairy ingredients added.","Barker's product page shows a Vegan dietary badge for this fruit tea syrup.","Woolworths NZ listing says this mini fruit ice confection is \"vegan friendly and 99% fat free\".","Twinings' English Breakfast product page shows a \"Vegan\" badge; ingredient is black tea.","Woolworths NZ listing states \"Vegan friendly and 99% fat free\" for this Calippo multipack.","Woolworths NZ pack claim says \"Vegan friendly\"; dark choc ingredients list no dairy.","Uncle Tobys' product page marks Cheerios Original as \"Vegan friendly\".","Blue Frog's product page for the porridge pockets says \"100% vegan\".","Remedy: \"Kombucha, Sodaly and Switchel are all vegan-friendly.\"","Woolworths NZ listing shows \"Vegan certified; Certified Vegan NZVS\" for these fruit sticks.","Obela NZ's Roasted Pine Nut Hommus page shows a Vegan badge; ingredients list no animal products.","Majans NZ FAQ: \"Bhuja snacks are suitable for Vegans and Vegetarians\"; this mix carries a Vegan friendly badge.","Massel states: \"All our products are vegan and always have been.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim: \"Vegan; USDA Organic\"; the coconut milk is plant milk.","Health Lab lists Mudcake Protein Bars in its \"Vegan Friendly\" collection of bars, balls and powders.","Obela NZ's Zesty Jalapeno Hommus page shows a Vegan badge; ingredients list no animal products.","Health Lab lists Choc Caramel Fudge Cake Protein Bars in its \"Vegan Friendly\" collection.","Health Lab lists Cookies & Crème Protein Bars in its \"Vegan Friendly\" collection.","Open Food Facts lists the Vegan label for Dolmio Extra Italian Herb pasta sauce.","Health Lab lists Chocolate Protein Wafer Bars in its \"Vegan Friendly\" collection.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ (maker of Copper Kettle) lists Copper Kettle Sea Salt as suitable for vegans.","Pepsi Max official FAQ: \"Yes, Pepsi MAX is suitable for both vegetarians and vegans.\"","Chelsea FAQ: nearly all its sugars and syrups suit vegans; the only exception is Honey Maple Flavoured Syrup.","Red Seal NZ FAQ: \"All Red Seal teas are made with only plant-based ingredients, so they're suitable for both vegetarians and vegans.\"","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but emulsifier 471 (source unstated) is listed; check first.","Pringles' Minis BBQ product page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Vitasoy's site lists Soy Milky Regular as suitable for vegetarians and vegans.","Macy & Tailor's Grain Free Tortilla Chip Spicy BBQ page lists \"Vegan & vegetarian\".","Macy & Tailor's Grain Free Tortilla Chip Salted page lists \"Vegan & vegetarian\".","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Feijoa 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","Lo Bros FAQ: \"Yes! We are 100% vegan.\" NZ Ginger & Turmeric 330ml ingredients list no animal products.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids.","PETA Australia's Accidentally Vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids under Lollies and Chocolate, with no flavour caveat.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ lists Bluebird Ready Salted (Originals, Thick Cut and Thinly Cut) as suitable for vegans.","Ceres Organics' product page lists the bar as \"Vegetarian, Vegan, Plant Based\" with a Vegan badge.","Leggo's Crushed Tomatoes page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Frooze Balls' site says of its range: \"100% natural. 100% vegan.\"; ingredients list no animal products.","Frooze Balls' Cookie Dough page says it is \"100% plant-based (vegan)\".","Frooze Balls' Peanut Butter & Jelly page says it is \"100% plant-based (vegan)\".","Frooze Balls' Raspberry Dark Choc page says they \"are gluten free, non-GMO, kosher and vegan\".","Frooze Balls' Lemon Cheesecake page says it is \"100% plant-based (vegan)\".","Bluebird's NZ FAQ lists Bluebird Ready Salted (Originals, Thick Cut, Thinly Cut) as suitable for vegans."],"S":["Woolworths label","Nature's Way (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","L'OR (manufacturer)","Kellogg's (manufacturer)","Jed's (manufacturer)","Barker's (manufacturer)","Twinings (manufacturer)","Uncle Tobys (manufacturer)","Blue Frog (manufacturer)","Remedy (manufacturer)","Obela (manufacturer)","Majans (manufacturer)","Massel (manufacturer)","Health Lab (manufacturer)","Open Food Facts","Bluebird (manufacturer)","Pepsi Max (manufacturer)","Chelsea (manufacturer)","Red Seal (manufacturer)","Pringles (manufacturer)","Vitasoy (manufacturer)","Macy & Tailor (manufacturer)","Lo Bros (manufacturer)","PETA Australia","Ceres Organics (manufacturer)","Leggo's (manufacturer)","Frooze Balls (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/pea-protein-powder/","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-acai-powder-75gm?variant=47804154282210","https://service.lorespresso.com/lorespresso-uk/","https://naturesway.co.nz/products/natures-way-kale-powder-120g","https://www.kelloggs.com.au/en_AU/products/just-right-original.html","https://www.jedscoffee.co.nz/contact/","https://barkers.co.nz/shop/feijoa-lime-500ml","https://twinings.com.au/products/english-breakfast","https://www.uncletobys.com.au/products/cereals/uncle-tobys-cheerios/original","https://bluefrogbreakfast.co.nz/products/vanilla-bean-chia-seed-porridge-copy-1","https://www.remedydrinks.com/blogs/news/are-remedy-drinks-vegan","https://obela.co.nz/products/obela-hommus